{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Moon Goddess... seemingly distraught, tears apart a barrier between worlds, causing planes to appear in different dimensions and realities entirely - while doing so she unleashes her Celestial Beings, causing the human plane to further mutate as magik from wilted realms seep into Midgard. The world today.. now exists as a cohesion between a new kind of normalcy - willfully forged, and post-apocalyptic dead-zones that humans have foregone due to strong manifestations of Celestial Magik...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>From time to time, Towers seem to appear out of nowhere.. those who wander into them are usually never seen or heard of again...these spaces have come to be known as Dungeons.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dungeons, are typically only tested and tried by those known as &quot; Scavengers&quot; , &quot;Wasties&quot;, or what the Goddess may deem them herself...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Moonlit Vassals.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/BuildA_-_Made_with_Clipchamp_2.gif?t=1745137136\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Gathering</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect materials (wood, stone, food) from the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-14_205754.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine resources to create tools, weapons, and shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-07_205813.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Health System +\u00a0Hunger and Thirst Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage injuries, illnesses, and overall health status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor and maintain character\u2019s nutrition and hydration levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-08_135734.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weather and Environmental Effects</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt to changing weather conditions (rain, snow) and temperature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/rainxx.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and upgrade shelters to protect against threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-24_143152.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in combat against enemies and wildlife.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Underground_Ruins_Party.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Foraging and Farming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather wild plants or cultivate crops for sustainable food sources.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/FFDeliveries_-_Made_with_Clipchamp_3.gif?t=1745137136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan activities around a dynamic time system that affects gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/uhoh.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Partner System: Contracting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out a partner of your choosing and attempt to contract with them to make them an ally, then level up along-side your partner and fight together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailor skills, appearance, and traits to suit different survival strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_205615.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Saving</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player data is saved locally, your character is yours. Keep your character and items when switching worlds.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Town_wideshot.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stat Allocation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will gain stat points as they level up that they can then distribute to grow stronger in the Wasteland.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-24_125222.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skills</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon meeting stat requirements, or discovering out in the Wasteland, players will be able to garner a roster of skills that they may then use to assist themelves and other wasties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/skillsxx.png?t=1745137136\" /></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">With friends the burden is lightened, gather your comrades and re-build the world together! ( NPC)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Farmlogo.png?t=1745137136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2024-11-21_124132.png?t=1745137136\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/Screenshot_2024-11-21_124110.png?t=1745137136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+multiplayer at a later date! ( coming soon )</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614050?t=1745137136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/54e5b61677d5d43244cec6cfc9d29a9e23d7e0fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745137136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/f83b70e1c4a55de2866f772cb7256105349bd9b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745137136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/f83b70e1